&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="https://africans.us/about-us/staff-board/" target="_blank"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Amaha Kassa&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/a&gt;, Executive Director, African Communities Together&lt;/li&gt;
