&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Lunch will be provided.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;There are options for in-person and virtual participation.&lt;/p&gt;

