&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Frustrated by the lack of clear AI guidelines for your classes?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Generative AI tools are evolving faster than course syllabi, leaving many students unsure of what&amp;rsquo;s allowed, what&amp;rsquo;s risky, and where the ethical boundaries actually lie.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Join &lt;strong&gt;CUIT&lt;/strong&gt; and the &lt;strong&gt;Director of Academic Integrity&lt;/strong&gt; for an interactive&amp;nbsp;45-minute workshop on &lt;strong&gt;Responsible AI&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;In this session, you will learn:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Privacy &amp;amp; Confidentiality:&lt;/strong&gt; How to use GenAI tools without accidentally sharing sensitive data or your personal intellectual property.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Bias &amp;amp; Accuracy:&lt;/strong&gt; How to spot algorithmic bias and evaluate AI outputs critically.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Academic Integrity:&lt;/strong&gt; Clear standards on acceptable AI use in your coursework so you can submit your assignments with complete confidence.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Get direct answers from campus experts so you can navigate AI responsibly and safeguard your academic standing.&lt;/p&gt;
